SUMMARY:Family Day: Boo on the Bayou 2026
DESCRIPTION:Save the Date to join us for our Boo on the Bayou Family Day! FREE entry to the museum 1-4pm. Come join us for maritime crafts\, engaging activities and hands-on learning as we celebrate our home in the East End! The event is FREE but we will ask you to please register. Registration will open soon. Hope to see you there. \n  \n 
URL:https://houstonmaritime.org/event/family-day-boo-on-the-bayou-2026/
LOCATION:Houston Maritime Center & Museum\, 2940 Riverby Rd\, Suite 200\, Houston\, TX\, 77020\, United States
CATEGORIES:Family Day
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://houstonmaritime.org/wp-content/uploads/Boo-on-the-Bayou-2026.pdf.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Houston Maritime Museum":MAILTO:info@houstonmaritime.org
